## Operation Modes

| Mode | CT | PWM | Behavior |
|------|----|-----|----------|
| Cooley-Tukey (FNTT) | 1 | 0 | E = A + B*W mod Q, O = A - B*W mod Q |
| Gentleman-Sande (INTT) | 0 | 0 | E = (A+B)*W mod Q, O = (A-B)*W mod Q |
| Pointwise Multiply | 1 | 1 | E = B*W mod Q, O = same |

In ALL modes: MUL outputs whatever the paper's modular multiplier computes (i.e., if it computes a*b*k mod q, MUL reflects that). ADD = (A+B) mod Q, SUB = (A-B) mod Q.

